WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:08.570
The visual tail you see trailing from a comet
has nothing to do with its direction of travel.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:13.990
It's actually because solar winds push on
its surrounding gasses, so that it always

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.580
points away from the Sun.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:30.840
A traffic jam once lasted for more than 10
days, with cars only moving 0.6 miles a day.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:36.690
If you could convert the mass in a one-kilogram
bag of sugar into energy, it would be enough

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:42.789
to drive a car non-stop for 100,000 years.

00:00:42.789 --> 00:00:49.199
People who feel lonely tend to wake up more
frequently throughout the night whilst sleeping.

00:00:49.199 --> 00:00:56.230
Monty Python's film Life of Brian was marketed
in Sweden as 'The film that's so funny, it

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:58.109
was banned in Norway.'

00:00:58.109 --> 00:01:03.239
Woolly Mammoths were still around when the
Egyptian Pyramids were being built.

00:01:03.239 --> 00:01:10.110
An Olympic rower named Henry Pearce once won
a race even though he stopped along the way

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:13.020
to let some ducks pass by.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:18.060
Everyone has a unique smell except for identical
twins.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:22.130
Asking someone "where are you" is a recent
phenomena.

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:27.899
Before we had mobile phone, the only way we
could talk to people is if we already knew

00:01:27.899 --> 00:01:30.010
where they were.

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:34.939
If you touch your tongue whilst yawning it
can stop the yawn.

00:01:34.939 --> 00:01:41.590
If you start with 1 penny and doubled your
money every day, it would only take 27 days

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:43.820
to become a millionaire.

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:51.310
In the entire state of Ohio in 1895, there
were only two cars on the road, and they crashed

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:52.789
into each other.

00:01:52.789 --> 00:01:59.469
Dr. Suess wrote "Green Eggs and Ham" to win
a bet against his publisher who thought that

00:01:59.469 --> 00:02:04.060
he could not complete a book using only 50
words.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:08.950
If you were to remove all of the empty space
from the atoms that make up every human on

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:14.360
Earth, the entire world's population could
fit inside an apple.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:22.440
In 1367, King Charles V of France explicitly
banned the wearing of shoes shaped like penises.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:29.000
Sloths sometimes mistakenly grab their own
arm instead of a tree branch with can lead

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.910
to a fatal fall.

